---
description: >-
  One representative railroad diagram in the redux family's `redux` theme. EBNF (`railroad-ebnf-beta`): a five-way choice, `[ ]` optionals, `{ }` repetition, a special sequence and an exception.
config:
  theme: redux
---
railroad-ebnf-beta
value = object | array | number | "true" | "null" ;
object = "{" , [ member , { "," , member } ] , "}" ;
number = [ "-" ] , digit , { digit } ;
digit = ? any decimal digit ? - "0" | "0" ;
